(text "Nominal 3.3 V: taps 0.825 / 1.650 / 2.475 V. Worst Rsource = 2k.\nNo external PSU or ignition signal enters this fixture. Disconnect power before tap changes.\nD1/D2 only candidate secondary clamps: rail back-power and -0.41 V / rail+0.41 V remain unresolved.\n3.3 V rail source, power budget, grounds and actual ADC header must be verified first.\nC1 adds settling memory: see calculate.py and README. No anti-alias accuracy claim." (at 15.24 142.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "01fc5bff-060c-5ca2-81d3-8241c9731eab"))
